<%#
  app/views/works_orders/_elcometer_toolbar.html.erb

  The single Elcometer connection for the page (elcometer-session controller
  wraps the operations list). Rendered once, inside the first anodic
  thickness card, so it sits where the operator is working.

  Two ways in, both feeding the same reading router:
    Cable     - Web Serial (RS232/USB, or a Bluetooth Classic gauge that
                Windows has paired as an outgoing COM port)
    Bluetooth - Web Bluetooth (BLE), no Windows pairing needed
  Buttons hide themselves if the browser lacks that API. The session
  auto-resumes the last transport after the sign-off reload.

  To pin a known service/characteristic once you've read them off the gauge,
  add to the elcometer-session element:
    data-elcometer-session-ble-service-value="…"
    data-elcometer-session-ble-notify-value="…"
    data-elcometer-session-ble-name-prefix-value="Elcometer"
%>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-3 p-2 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-md">
  <div data-elcometer-session-target="status"
       class="flex-1 text-sm border rounded-md px-3 py-2 bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 border-gray-200">
    Connect the Elcometer to auto-fill readings.
  </div>
  <div class="flex gap-2 shrink-0">
    <button type="button"
            data-elcometer-session-target="connectButton"
            data-action="click->elcometer-session#connectElcometer"
            class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1.5 border border-blue-600 rounded text-xs font-medium text-blue-600 bg-white hover:bg-blue-50">
      <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 mr-1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
      Cable
    </button>
    <button type="button"
            data-elcometer-session-target="bluetoothButton"
            data-action="click->elcometer-session#connectBluetooth"
            class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1.5 border border-blue-600 rounded text-xs font-medium text-blue-600 bg-white hover:bg-blue-50">
      <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 mr-1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v18l6-4.5L7 8m0 8l11-8.5L12 3"/></svg>
      Bluetooth
    </button>
    <button type="button"
            data-elcometer-session-target="stopButton"
            data-action="click->elcometer-session#stopReading"
            class="hidden inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1.5 border border-red-600 rounded text-xs font-medium text-red-600 bg-white hover:bg-red-50">
      <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 mr-1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
      Disconnect
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
